	<section_number>59.1-384</section_number>
	<catch_line>Denial of license final</catch_line>
	<text>
		The denial of an owner's or operator's license by the Commission shall be final unless appealed under § 59.1-373.
	</text>
	<history>1988, c. 855.</history>
